* | Rs +12,264 (+0.61%) |\n\nUSD/INR 94.9050: Yahoo USDINR=X close of 2026-11-02. Of the US sleeve's INR P&L, Rs +2,011.11 is FX (start rate 94.5248). Check against the RBI/FBIL reference rate (https://www.fbil.org.in/); they differ by a few paise.\n\n## Claude's review\n\n### What happened today\n- Momentum: no fills. Equity Rs 513,388 (day +Rs 4,714, total +Rs 13,388). Five positions held; DRREDDY (+11.8%) and ADANIPORTS (+6.9%) did most of the work, TECHM is -2.8%.\n- Thesis: no fills. Sleeve Rs 496,864 (-Rs 3,136, almost all realised from Waaree). ICICIBANK +1.2%; ONGC/HINDPETRO pair +Rs 849 combined. BAJFINANCE catalyst BUY is dated 2026-11-19 and is not yet due.\n- India F&O: no positions, all cash (Rs 500,000). US: no positions; Rs +2,011 is purely USD/INR drift (94.5248 to 94.9050), not trading.\n\n### What looks right / what looks wrong\n- Journal equity (Rs 513,388) equals the last equity_curve row; day P&L 4,714 = 513,388 - 508,675. No fills, so no ledger or charge cross-check was needed; charges unchanged at Rs 1,280.\n- No rejected orders in any sleeve. Momentum proposes no orders and every held name is still in the top 10 by momentum, so nothing looks weak.\n- Note: the thesis journal section still shows the BAJFINANCE order with its 19 Nov decision date; that is intended, not an error.\n\n### Progress vs target\n- Momentum averages Rs 1,030/day over 13 days against Rs 1,250 pre-tax (net Rs 1,000). Too early to judge. Combined all sleeves: +Rs 12,264 (+0.61%).\n\n### Decisions\nNone. No drafted thesis is ready (only BAJFINANCE, already scheduled), and no F&O or US setup justifies a position today; doing nothing is a valid decision. Index futures do not fit the 10% order limit.\n\n### Rule change proposals\nNone.\n\n### Watch tomorrow\n- TECHM stop 1,709.64 vs close 1,789.10 (about 4.4% away); HCLTECH stop 1,311.95 vs 1,439.10.\n- ICICIBANK invalidation 1,320 vs close 1,424.50.\n- ONGC/HINDPETRO pair: Brent versus its 15 Oct level; post-event rule due a